            "notes": "Now that you've completed round one, we can start getting a little more deadly.\n\nWe're going to buy [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) to increase our damage output followed by [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) & [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa) to increase our speed and be harder to punish.\n\nYour goal is still to cause chaos in the backline to the supports, but you can start heading off into jumping\\distracting the dps if you have time. \n\nIf there is a [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da)/[Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18) and you're having trouble eliminating them get yourself a [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182)\n\n```\nIf you didn't already know which you should:\nA quick melee right before a Blink can finish off a low-health enemy with an instant punch once your blink finishes.\n```",
