            "notes": "You made it to **Round 3**, I'm so proud of you!\n\nHere we're going to get the power [Timelapse](item_20d43db5-d2ad-47e9-b32f-82d8eca006ce) as it'll help us finish off enemies quicker and hopefully end anyone surviving on ***1hp***.\n\nNext, we're going to sell our [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) I know I know it sounds weird but, we're going to pick up [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) to make up for it and with the cooldown reduction from those 2 and the added damage whenever you use a blink you wont even remember the name of that um other perk thing what was it again.",
