            "notes": "You made it to ***Round 4!*** YAY\n\nNow we're going to start eliminating some green by mopping up the [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and cleaning out our [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa), we're going to gain a slot back by combining these into [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)!\n\nWe're also going to melt our [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) to obtain some [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) and [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) *(if you have enough then get [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) instead)* these will let us keep the cooldown reduction combo that with the overhealth gained whenever we blink, we'll have overhealth for ~~days~~ hours!\n\nI know I know this is a lot to take in, but if you're struggling with the money, you can skip out on [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)/[The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) and keep [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) for now. and add extra damage with any leftover money.",
