            "notes": "In ***Round 5*** we're going to get the [Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c), I know I know it sounds weird. but it will bait out cooldowns and cause panic with the supports, get one to stick while someone is already low? they're dead. Jump an innocent zen and make them panic ult thinking its a real pulse.\n\nIf you however refuse to get that power, you could also pick up [Bullet Time](item_6840382c-ae92-491a-b70c-b49f3a76003a)... It's whatever....\n\nFor our purchases, here is where we become an unkillable annoying fly, we're going to get [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) & since we can charge out ult quickly you should have it by the mid/end of the first team fight or your 3rd flank, once you get ult **HOLD IT*, don't touch it, don't look at it, don't anything unless you **REALLY** have to (maybe zarya grav's everybody and they're all low... who knows). since the 38 extra health along with everything else is what levels us up, you can now use your recall as your pulse to just bait everything out.\n\nIf you have any leftover cash, get [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) and if your wallet is bigger than I've imagined then select [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2).",
